      "x": 62,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 1580,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "Q107 / Q109 / Q112 (the require_positive payment rosters).  Same class as F4 #834 - VIDEO-CONFIRMED on v1.0.3:\nentered Rs.500 -> partial save -> resume -> Q107 reads 0 and the #757 'enter amount > 0' check HARD-BLOCKS.",
