    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cruxt",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 282,
      "width": 1550,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "THE CRUX:  the per-row #757 reenter + the LINE-preproc non-money zeroing ('if src <> money then amt=0') are\nPER-OCCURRENCE logic that misfires when CSPro replays the roster on resume - the exact F4 #834 class we already fixed.",
      "originalText": "THE CRUX:  the per-row #757 reenter + the LINE-preproc non-money zeroing ('if src <> money then amt=0') are\nPER-OCCURRENCE logic that misfires when CSPro replays the roster on resume - the exact F4 #834 class we already fixed.",
