    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rect",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1128,
      "width": 1545,
      "height": 53,
      "text": "RECOMMENDATION  ->  Option A.   It's the F4 #834 fix, proven on this exact bug class: pull the per-row #757 reenter +\nthe on-replay zeroing (what the resume trips on), keep the 'amount > 0' nudge as one soft check after the roster, and\nharden it uniformly across the F3 payment rosters.   B bets on a resume signal CSPro doesn't expose; C risks re-triggering the replay.",
      "originalText": "RECOMMENDATION  ->  Option A.   It's the F4 #834 fix, proven on this exact bug class: pull the per-row #757 reenter +\nthe on-replay zeroing (what the resume trips on), keep the 'amount > 0' nudge as one soft check after the roster, and\nharden it uniformly across the F3 payment rosters.   B bets on a resume signal CSPro doesn't expose; C risks re-triggering the replay.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
